      produced (§§0–1, `access.md`).
- [ ] Every material finding has evidence state, source ID, exact locator, and
      direct-evidence/inference mark; no claim rests on a snippet (§2).
- [ ] Every load-bearing conclusion has an inspected primary or remains an unresolved gap; its
      challenge search and source dependencies were recorded (§§2.1–2.2).
- [ ] Every material absence claim carries the §3 search record and is bounded unless the corpus
