./SCHEMATIC-REVIEW.md-87-output to ground. TI OPAx333 SBOS351E, Figure 15 on PDF page 11, shows rising
./SCHEMATIC-REVIEW.md-88-overshoot over only 10 pF to 1000 pF; the plotted response is already about
./SCHEMATIC-REVIEW.md-89-40% at the upper end. The schematic load is 4700 times that plotted upper
./SCHEMATIC-REVIEW.md-90-capacitance, and the design record supplies no isolation resistor, loop analysis,
./SCHEMATIC-REVIEW.md-91-or bench validation. This does not prove oscillation, but it is far outside the
./SCHEMATIC-REVIEW.md:92:validated evidence and can corrupt both LMP91000 bias and ADS1119 reference.
