./firmware/platformio.ini:220:; and AIN3 (VIN monitor); a replacement part is on order. Both are diagnostic
./firmware/platformio.ini:221:; channels - AIN0, the oxygen measurement, is unaffected - so this build lets
./firmware/platformio.ini-222-; the cell work proceed by substituting a MANUALLY MEASURED reference for the
./firmware/platformio.ini-223-; one firmware can no longer read.
