./firmware/src/mcu_adc.h-5- * 3V3A brownout - which silently drops the LMP91000's volatile configuration
./firmware/src/mcu_adc.h-6- * and therefore the cell bias, with the MCU still happily running
./firmware/src/mcu_adc.h-7- * (PLAN.md:273-280) - is detectable at all.
