./firmware/src/mcu_adc.h-9- * This ADC's reference is VREF+ = 3V3D, a different rail, so absolute volts
./firmware/src/mcu_adc.h-10- * come from the factory VREFINT calibration rather than an assumed 3.3 V.
./firmware/src/mcu_adc.h-11- */
