25-    25	     * clips at VREF/4 = 625 mV, and the oxygen channel swings about 1.06 V
26-    26	     * from its 1.675 V zero - so gain 4 is unusable here, not merely
27-    27	     * unnecessary. Single-shot because the sample loop is 1 Hz: continuous
28-    28	     * conversion would keep the modulator running for nothing. */
