33:+# 3 ANODE -- AZ431-A datasheet Rev 3.4, "Pin Configuration", N Package figure.
34-+# NO KiCad TL431 variant carries that map: TL431DBZ is 1 K / 2 REF / 3 A, and
35-+# TL431LP and TL431KTP are 1 REF / 2 A / 3 K. Dropping in TL431DBZ would have
36-+# silently transposed REF and the cathode. So the shunt-regulator GRAPHIC is
37-+# taken from TL431DBZ and only its pin NUMBERS are remapped onto the package we
38-+# actually buy; pin positions are untouched, so the drawing stays correct.
